 "description": "Approves the storyboard and starts production. **This spends credits and they are not refundable.** It covers both ways Huasheng asks for approval: PLAN_READY, and PAUSED where it asks as a question. Before calling it, inspect plan_requirements and cost_points from the latest project status. You may approve directly when that is a reasonable execution of the user's delegated goal. Otherwise show both in text and stop for the user. Never request a blind approval. The project may queue before production starts. First track the returned action.operation.id with huasheng_wait_for_action until the approval is authoritative, then use huasheng_wait_for_project for the next project decision.",
